@startuml
title Activity Diagram - View Explainable Results

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 180

note top
Steps:
1) Open TaskResult
2) Display answer + confidence
3) Show EvidenceRefs
4) If user opens evidence, jump to page/timestamp in asset
5) Export/share or add feedback
6) Save audit trail
end note

(*) --> "1. Open TaskResult"
--> "2. Display answer\n+ confidence"
--> "3. Show EvidenceRefs"

if "Open evidence?" then
  -->[Yes] "4. Jump to page/timestamp\nin asset"
  --> "5. Export/share\nor add feedback"
else
  -->[No] "5. Export/share\nor add feedback"
endif

--> "6. Save audit trail"
--> (*)

@enduml